  "body": "## What\n\nDeclares `users.users.user.linger = true;` in `nixos/users/user/default.nix`.\n\n## Why\n\nIssue #5443: on amd-6, `loginctl show-user user -p Linger` returns `Linger=yes` and `/var/lib/systemd/linger/user` exists — but that state is **imperative** (set by hand around 2026-10-23 for RustDesk) and declared nowhere in this repo. A reinstall or a config rebuild from a tree that does not know about it would silently lose it, and the failure mode (systemd user services simply not running until someone logs in) is easy to miss.\n\nLinger starts the user manager at boot so user services (e.g. the OpenClaw gateway) run unattended after a reboot.\n\n## Boundary (kept in the code comment)\n\nLinger does **not** unlock the GNOME keyring. Keyring-held credentials still require a graphical login — observed 2026-11-04, and the laptop `gh` token was independently found dead. Boot-independent services must use file-based secrets (sops / Bitwarden), never the keyring or the interactive `gh` credential.\n\n## Change\n\nOne attribute plus an explanatory comment; no other behaviour changes, no dedicated switch.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `nix-instantiate --parse nixos/users/user/default.nix` — OK\n- No `linger` declaration existed anywhere else in the tree before this change (`grep -rn linger --include=*.nix` found only prose in `home/openclaw/default.nix`).\n\nCloses #5443\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796733684&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7685&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7685&signature=33f9a67483785692818e2c70a093ce48aab747ee038dcd7bc4827303fb0eea55\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7685?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
